# The generated skill bundle is produced with LF and compared byte-for-byte by
# `scripts/gen-skill-bundle.mjs --check` (the release gate). Without this, a Windows
# checkout turns it into CRLF and `--check` reads it as "stale" though the content is
# identical — which would block `scripts/release.mjs` on Windows. Pin it to LF.
src/skill-bundle.generated.ts text eol=lf

# Skill source files are published as LF from Linux (app.geoly.ai); the bundle hashes
# them LF-normalized. Keep the local checkout LF too so every parity check agrees.
skills/** text eol=lf
